which is this Illuminator who radiates.
{7} this I say to you, my brothers and my beloveds:
gird yourselves and exercise yourselves and proclaim to the
souls — that they may receive (it) for themselves immediately, while life still exists for their
repentance, while there is yet a moment for the Good — before
they shut the gate and leave the souls locked outside
before the gate of Life, and they pay honor (as tribute) upon the face of the Enemy.
{8} his disciples heard these things, they trembled, they were afraid, they were troubled.
